{"bvid": "BV1184y1E7zY", "title": "如何有效复盘自己呢口译练习录音？", "duration": 630, "subs": [{"cid": 1029651133, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 317, "body": [{"from": 0.0, "to": 0.3, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "hello", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.3, "to": 0.6, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "大家好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 0.6, "to": 2.34, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "我是口译老师jacky", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 2.34, "to": 3.18, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "那今天开始", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.18, "to": 5.52, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "中心呢是公布了去年11月份", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.52, "to": 7.94, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "口译笔译的这个考试成绩啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 7.94, "to": 11.85, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "有几位同学呢考试最终口译实务呢是50多分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.85, "to": 13.02, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "然后差那么一点点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.02, "to": 15.03, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "和我今天预约了口译测试", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 15.03, "to": 18.35, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "那我结合这几位同学一个口译测试录音的表现", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.35, "to": 19.55, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "来跟大家分享一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.55, "to": 22.01, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "就是如果你口译去考实务的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 22.01, "to": 22.85, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "也是50多分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 22.85, "to": 24.23, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "可能问题出在哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 24.23, "to": 25.459, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "跟大家分享一下啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.459, "to": 28.159, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "我跟大家点评口语录音的一个思路啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.159, "to": 29.779, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "大家平常无论是自己练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.779, "to": 31.399, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "还是说组队练习的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.399, "to": 33.91, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "可以按照这样的一个思路去进行复盘", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.91, "to": 36.91, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "那首先我们其实可以把它分成几个维度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 36.91, "to": 40.28, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "我一般我会分成两个维度来看待一段口译录音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.28, "to": 43.49, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "首先你必须要确保就是你练这段口译的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.49, "to": 45.62, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "必须是这个录音播放结束之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.62, "to": 47.12, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "你三秒内开口啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 47.12, "to": 50.43, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "这段录音呢我去复盘才有意义啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.43, "to": 51.99, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "有的朋友可能平常练习的时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.99, "to": 53.58, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "会有一个不太好的习惯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.58, "to": 55.23, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "就是总是想啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.23, "to": 56.4, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "等自己想好了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.4, "to": 59.31, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "准备好了之后再开口去翻译", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.31, "to": 60.21, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "那这个时候呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 60.21, "to": 61.71, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "你中间等待的这个时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 61.71, "to": 63.87, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "给了自己太多人为的一个缓冲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 63.87, "to": 66.18, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "等于说你创造了一个更舒适的环境", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.18, "to": 67.42, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "让自己去练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.42, "to": 69.22, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "那你这样翻翻的再流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 69.22, "to": 71.489, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "再好你等到考试的环境当中啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.489, "to": 72.869, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "他那个录音播放结束", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.869, "to": 73.559, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "低声开始", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.559, "to": 74.369, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "你就得说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.369, "to": 78.24, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "如果中间开口和这个笛声之间差了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.24, "to": 80.74, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "有大概五六秒或者说更长的时间", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.74, "to": 83.56, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "那么录进去呢可能就是你周边同学口译的声音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.56, "to": 84.4, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "而不是你的声音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 84.4, "to": 87.84, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "那这样的话呢考试的扣分是比较多的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 87.84, "to": 89.94, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "那这是一个开口习惯的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.94, "to": 93.6, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "那第二呢如果你在标准的时间内开口翻译了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.6, "to": 95.72, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "那我们去评判的维度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.72, "to": 98.44, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "第一个呢就是你的这个语音面貌啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.44, "to": 99.88, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "语音面貌主要就是包括", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 99.88, "to": 102.76, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "比如说我们最直观的感受就是流畅度嘛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 102.76, "to": 104.74, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "流畅度这方面呢大家注意几个点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.74, "to": 107.62, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "第一个就是你可以去听你这一段录音当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 107.62, "to": 109.09, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "有多少次nr", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 109.09, "to": 110.65, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "通常我一般会建议大家呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.65, "to": 112.39, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "就是听到一次就记录一次", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.39, "to": 114.43, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "可以用画正字的方式去记录", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.43, "to": 115.33, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "最后统计一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 115.33, "to": 117.64, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "比如说一段一分钟的口译录音当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 117.64, "to": 120.76, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "你出现了十次或者15次以上的这种nr", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 120.76, "to": 123.06, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "那这一段肯定是没有办法及格的对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.06, "to": 124.32, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "我个人的一个标准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 124.32, "to": 128.369, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "就是尽量的让自己的这个录音当中的n啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.369, "to": 131.849, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "一段当中控制在三处以内啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.849, "to": 132.689, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "这样会比较好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 132.689, "to": 134.04, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "尽量做到一个清零", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.04, "to": 138.12, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "然后第二呢影响流畅度的一个因素就是改口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.12, "to": 140.23, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "因为有的同学呢会有一些习惯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.23, "to": 144.18, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "总觉得啊像像笔译的那种思维带到了口译里面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.18, "to": 145.5, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "也就是自己翻完", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 145.5, "to": 147.56, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "觉得好像我这里有一个主要一致的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.56, "to": 149.3, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "或者觉得我这里没有加一个s", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 149.3, "to": 152.3, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "或者说哎我觉得呃前面那个词没说好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.3, "to": 156.22, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "总是想迂回回去再重新开始说这种改口呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 156.22, "to": 157.42, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "你也可以做一个记录", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 157.42, "to": 159.16, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "用画正字的形式去统计", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 159.16, "to": 160.3, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "一定要去改掉", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.3, "to": 162.04, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "如果不是说特别严重的错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.04, "to": 163.39, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "比如说像数字错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 163.39, "to": 165.15, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "像这个句子的呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.15, "to": 166.68, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "核心词术语说错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 166.68, "to": 170.46, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "或者会影响这个句子关键语义传达的地方对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.46, "to": 172.08, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "如果不是这样的核心内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.08, "to": 172.62, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "你出错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.62, "to": 174.34, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "你就先顺过去往下说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.34, "to": 178.24, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "这一遍呢我先保证这个流畅度和完整度啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 178.24, "to": 179.74, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "如果是只是一个冠词啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.74, "to": 183.54, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "一个s没有必要过度的反复的去改口去重复说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 183.54, "to": 186.31, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "这就像你在现场对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 186.31, "to": 189.07, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "去演唱或者说现场去做即兴演讲", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 189.07, "to": 190.51, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "你不会因为说错了一个词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 190.51, "to": 192.97, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "或者说有一句歌词当中某一个词啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 192.97, "to": 194.88, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "唱错了你就停停下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 194.88, "to": 196.23, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "然后倒回去重新唱", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.23, "to": 196.8, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 196.8, "to": 197.82, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "底下的听众", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 197.82, "to": 201.87, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "或者说观众的这种听感或者感受呢是不太好的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 201.87, "to": 205.58, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "卡顿和这种ni以及改口多的话呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 205.58, "to": 207.8, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "会让老师对你的这个delivery啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 207.8, "to": 209.12, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "扣掉比较多的分数", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 209.12, "to": 210.59, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "还有第三个呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 210.59, "to": 214.15, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "就是大家有的一些同学他没有n r也不改口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 214.15, "to": 215.32, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "但是他的一个习惯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 215.32, "to": 217.83, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "就是说总是在口译的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 217.83, "to": 219.7, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "是一个词一个词往外蹦的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 219.7, "to": 222.28, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "而不是一句话或一个一群一个一群去输出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 222.28, "to": 222.82, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "这个习惯的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 222.82, "to": 223.39, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "也是要改", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 223.39, "to": 226.18, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "这就可能跟你自己在读笔记或者记笔记的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 226.18, "to": 227.22, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "这个习惯有关系", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 227.22, "to": 228.66, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "你像咱们的呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 228.66, "to": 231.66, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "这个口译的一个笔记或者脑机的原则", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 231.66, "to": 233.49, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "就是我一次记啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 233.49, "to": 235.11, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "我一个句子的主谓谓宾啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.11, "to": 235.95, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "我要记清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 235.95, "to": 238.59, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "所以我读的时候呢就是一个一群一个群", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 238.59, "to": 241.07, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "一个主谓或者一个主谓宾啊去输出", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 241.07, "to": 244.35, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话就可以避免像挤牙膏一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 244.35, "to": 245.37, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "先出一个主语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 245.37, "to": 246.93, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "等一两秒再出一个谓语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 246.93, "to": 248.16, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "再等一等马出个宾语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 248.16, "to": 250.88, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话观众听起来会非常的着急", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 250.88, "to": 252.38, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "也是这种听感不好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 252.38, "to": 253.85, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "所以这是流畅度方面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 253.85, "to": 255.68, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以去复盘的几个因素", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 255.68, "to": 259.52, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "有没有n r去统计一下有没有改口", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 259.52, "to": 261.95, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "以及有没有出现这种挤牙膏式的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 261.95, "to": 263.62, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "这样的一种输出好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 263.62, "to": 265.3, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "然后除了这个流畅度以外呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 265.3, "to": 268.16, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "语音面貌的另外一个因素就是你的发音对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 268.16, "to": 270.95, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "发音不是说你一定要说做到纯音是纯美式", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 270.95, "to": 272.51, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "毕竟咱们不是演讲比赛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 272.51, "to": 275.89, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "我们更重要的是让听众清晰的接受到信息", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 275.89, "to": 278.41, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "所以你只要做到的是发音清晰标准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 278.41, "to": 279.25, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "听起来舒服", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 279.25, "to": 280.42, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "能让人听得下去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 280.42, "to": 281.59, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "基本上就ok了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 281.59, "to": 282.67, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "当然你说的越标准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 282.67, "to": 283.45, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "分数越高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 283.45, "to": 284.94, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "给人的感觉会越专业", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 284.94, "to": 287.88, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "如果说你说出来这个英文重音出错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 287.88, "to": 289.83, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "或者说这个音的音标记错了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 289.83, "to": 291.9, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "或者说这个音的元音啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 291.9, "to": 294.58, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "读起来别人无法判断是哪个词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 294.58, "to": 296.17, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "那有这种情况的话呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 296.17, "to": 298.3, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "呃这个语音面貌的扣分会比较多", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 298.3, "to": 299.56, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "大家可以试想一下对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 299.56, "to": 300.64, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "一个人开口说英语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 300.64, "to": 301.78, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "其实听两句", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 301.78, "to": 304.97, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "你就大概知道它的这个发音习惯是不是标准的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 304.97, "to": 305.87, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "是不是清晰的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 305.87, "to": 308.21, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "从而大概也会有一个出印象了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 308.21, "to": 309.77, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "所以发音在口音这一块呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 309.77, "to": 311.23, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "可以当做你的一个名片", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 311.23, "to": 313.75, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "大家平常还是要多多的去注重", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 313.75, "to": 318.18, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "去练习一下自己的这个发音的表现好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 318.18, "to": 320.4, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "那除了语音面貌这一块呢啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 320.4, "to": 323.469, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "第二个评判的一个维度就是你的语言质量", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 323.469, "to": 324.999, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "通常啊只要做到流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 324.999, "to": 325.919, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "发音清晰", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 325.919, "to": 327.839, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "给人留下的印象呢一般都不错", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 327.839, "to": 330.719, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "就是我们能够愿意啊耐心的再往下去听", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 330.719, "to": 332.18, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "你说了些什么内容对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 332.18, "to": 333.74, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "你发音的这个习惯不好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 333.74, "to": 334.4, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "流畅度不够", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 334.4, "to": 335.6, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "其实很多人是听不下去的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 335.6, "to": 338.24, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "就到不了这个语言质量这个环节好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 338.24, "to": 339.56, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "那在语言质量这个环节中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 339.56, "to": 342.44, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "我们关注的是第一个就是我听你说的这个内容", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 342.44, "to": 344.579, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "它有没有明显的语法错误对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 344.579, "to": 347.0, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "语法的意识通常有同学说的很流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 347.0, "to": 348.86, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "但是你细听你就会发现诶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 348.86, "to": 350.72, "sid": 173, "location": 2, "content": "它这个句子里面全是名词堆在一起", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 350.72, "to": 353.159, "sid": 174, "location": 2, "content": "或者说他没有这种主谓宾谓宾的意识", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 353.159, "to": 355.019, "sid": 175, "location": 2, "content": "还有个同学就是词性乱用对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 355.019, "to": 355.799, "sid": 176, "location": 2, "content": "名词当动词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 355.799, "to": 356.339, "sid": 177, "location": 2, "content": "用动词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.339, "to": 356.819, "sid": 178, "location": 2, "content": "当名词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 356.819, "to": 360.5, "sid": 179, "location": 2, "content": "用形容词和副词的这种成分的分不清楚", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 360.5, "to": 362.15, "sid": 180, "location": 2, "content": "所以说如果你一句话当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 362.15, "to": 365.05, "sid": 181, "location": 2, "content": "有明显的这种词性错误成分错误的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 365.05, "to": 366.79, "sid": 182, "location": 2, "content": "那出现的频率比较高", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 366.79, "to": 369.19, "sid": 183, "location": 2, "content": "老师对你的这个语法意识的印象呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 369.19, "to": 372.759, "sid": 184, "location": 2, "content": "就会啊给的就会比较差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 372.759, "to": 374.559, "sid": 185, "location": 2, "content": "然后会有比较多的扣分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 374.559, "to": 376.599, "sid": 186, "location": 2, "content": "还有就是英文当中的这个时态时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 376.599, "to": 379.11, "sid": 187, "location": 2, "content": "语态时间呢就是啊你要区分过去", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 379.11, "to": 380.22, "sid": 188, "location": 2, "content": "现在将来对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 380.22, "to": 382.08, "sid": 189, "location": 2, "content": "如果人家说得过去的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 382.08, "to": 383.28, "sid": 190, "location": 2, "content": "你把它翻成将来时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 383.28, "to": 384.3, "sid": 191, "location": 2, "content": "人家说的现在的事情", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 384.3, "to": 385.53, "sid": 192, "location": 2, "content": "你把它翻成未来时", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 385.53, "to": 387.78, "sid": 193, "location": 2, "content": "那这样的话明显的是会扣分的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 387.78, "to": 390.56, "sid": 194, "location": 2, "content": "就是时间的这个意识啊没有到位", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 390.56, "to": 392.72, "sid": 195, "location": 2, "content": "第二呢就是太太包括什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 392.72, "to": 394.16, "sid": 196, "location": 2, "content": "第一个就是情态对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 394.16, "to": 395.51, "sid": 197, "location": 2, "content": "原本没有情态动词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 395.51, "to": 397.91, "sid": 198, "location": 2, "content": "大家其实做那种啊听力选择题的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 397.91, "to": 398.75, "sid": 199, "location": 2, "content": "有情态动词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 398.75, "to": 399.41, "sid": 200, "location": 2, "content": "没有情态动词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 399.41, "to": 401.57, "sid": 201, "location": 2, "content": "可能那个听力选择的答案就不一样了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 401.57, "to": 402.11, "sid": 202, "location": 2, "content": "是不是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 402.11, "to": 404.72, "sid": 203, "location": 2, "content": "所以如果你这个是情态不注意的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 404.72, "to": 407.63, "sid": 204, "location": 2, "content": "你传达出去的这个语气意思呢也是会有偏离的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 407.63, "to": 411.09, "sid": 205, "location": 2, "content": "还有就是啊这个主动主动态还是被动态对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 411.09, "to": 412.38, "sid": 206, "location": 2, "content": "主被动混淆了的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 412.38, "to": 414.06, "sid": 207, "location": 2, "content": "这个句子就会出现语法错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 414.06, "to": 415.44, "sid": 208, "location": 2, "content": "或者说这个逻辑关系错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 415.44, "to": 419.04, "sid": 209, "location": 2, "content": "还有一个就是它的一个呃这个状态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 419.04, "to": 421.09, "sid": 210, "location": 2, "content": "比如说它是进行态对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 421.09, "to": 422.83, "sid": 211, "location": 2, "content": "它是一个完成态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 422.83, "to": 425.95, "sid": 212, "location": 2, "content": "这些也是自己这个语法当中要去注意的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 425.95, "to": 429.23, "sid": 213, "location": 2, "content": "所以说这个时间和这个语态啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 429.23, "to": 431.03, "sid": 214, "location": 2, "content": "大家也是在复盘的过程当中呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 431.03, "to": 432.89, "sid": 215, "location": 2, "content": "需要去做这个不仅是口译", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 432.89, "to": 433.61, "sid": 216, "location": 2, "content": "你的写作", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 433.61, "to": 435.97, "sid": 217, "location": 2, "content": "笔译当中呢也是要去留心的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 435.97, "to": 437.29, "sid": 218, "location": 2, "content": "尤其是在笔写作当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 437.29, "to": 440.51, "sid": 219, "location": 2, "content": "这方面可能老师更加的去注重一些好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 440.51, "to": 441.71, "sid": 220, "location": 2, "content": "那除了语法之外呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 441.71, "to": 442.43, "sid": 221, "location": 2, "content": "就是词汇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 442.43, "to": 445.47, "sid": 222, "location": 2, "content": "词汇主要就是你用的这个词适不适合对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 445.47, "to": 447.36, "sid": 223, "location": 2, "content": "能不能表达这个意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 447.36, "to": 450.559, "sid": 224, "location": 2, "content": "如果你的这个词混淆了啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 450.559, "to": 452.899, "sid": 225, "location": 2, "content": "一个褒义的语义", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 452.899, "to": 454.39, "sid": 226, "location": 2, "content": "你用了一个贬义词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 454.39, "to": 455.95, "sid": 227, "location": 2, "content": "那这个时候呢也会扣分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 455.95, "to": 458.65, "sid": 228, "location": 2, "content": "还有就是这个词的固定搭配以积累的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 458.65, "to": 459.67, "sid": 229, "location": 2, "content": "对不对啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 459.67, "to": 460.99, "sid": 230, "location": 2, "content": "这个搭配一定要记准啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 460.99, "to": 461.95, "sid": 231, "location": 2, "content": "如果你没记准的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 461.95, "to": 463.48, "sid": 232, "location": 2, "content": "去随口乱说的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 463.48, "to": 466.66, "sid": 233, "location": 2, "content": "那最终人家只能听到你在流畅的说很多的单词", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 466.66, "to": 468.04, "sid": 234, "location": 2, "content": "但是组合在一起的意思呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 468.04, "to": 470.18, "sid": 235, "location": 2, "content": "我是听不懂你在说啥的好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 470.18, "to": 471.35, "sid": 236, "location": 2, "content": "这是原质量方面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 471.35, "to": 472.22, "sid": 237, "location": 2, "content": "那还有一个点呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 472.22, "to": 474.48, "sid": 238, "location": 2, "content": "就是啊你的这个还原度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 474.48, "to": 477.18, "sid": 239, "location": 2, "content": "很多同学其实说口译我做到了流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 477.18, "to": 478.26, "sid": 240, "location": 2, "content": "而且我说出来的句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 478.26, "to": 480.38, "sid": 241, "location": 2, "content": "也没有明显的语法错误和词汇错误啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 480.38, "to": 482.18, "sid": 242, "location": 2, "content": "但是为什么我去考二口的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 482.18, "to": 485.08, "sid": 243, "location": 2, "content": "分数总是卡在什么57 58这个分数呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 485.08, "to": 486.58, "sid": 244, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候你就要去思考一下", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 486.58, "to": 490.32, "sid": 245, "location": 2, "content": "是不是你的这个逻辑和意思出现了偏差", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 490.32, "to": 492.87, "sid": 246, "location": 2, "content": "因为我做测试的时候也有一波这样的同学啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 492.87, "to": 495.93, "sid": 247, "location": 2, "content": "嗯你读一段大概四五十秒的中文段子给他", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 495.93, "to": 498.81, "sid": 248, "location": 2, "content": "他其实基本上关键词都能够说出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 498.81, "to": 500.01, "sid": 249, "location": 2, "content": "但问题就是在于", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 500.01, "to": 502.89, "sid": 250, "location": 2, "content": "它这些关键词组合在一起的这个逻辑和意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 502.89, "to": 504.35, "sid": 251, "location": 2, "content": "跟原文会有一些偏离", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 504.35, "to": 507.23, "sid": 252, "location": 2, "content": "所以如果你的二口食物是57啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 507.23, "to": 507.59, "sid": 253, "location": 2, "content": "58", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 507.59, "to": 508.91, "sid": 254, "location": 2, "content": "59这样的一个分数的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 508.91, "to": 511.85, "sid": 255, "location": 2, "content": "你可以仔细的去把你的这个口音的录音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 511.85, "to": 512.829, "sid": 256, "location": 2, "content": "转写成文字", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 512.829, "to": 515.889, "sid": 257, "location": 2, "content": "然后对照着那个参考原文或者参考译文", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 515.889, "to": 517.269, "sid": 258, "location": 2, "content": "一句一句的去看诶", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 517.269, "to": 519.57, "sid": 259, "location": 2, "content": "是不是我这些词组合在一起的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 519.57, "to": 522.09, "sid": 260, "location": 2, "content": "意思是原文要传递的这个意思", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 522.09, "to": 523.59, "sid": 261, "location": 2, "content": "逻辑关系对不对对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 523.59, "to": 524.73, "sid": 262, "location": 2, "content": "修饰关系对不对", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 524.73, "to": 526.5, "sid": 263, "location": 2, "content": "你只是把这些词抓到", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 526.5, "to": 527.28, "sid": 264, "location": 2, "content": "把它拼出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 527.28, "to": 528.96, "sid": 265, "location": 2, "content": "另外一的一个意思的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 528.96, "to": 530.19, "sid": 266, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话还原度不够", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 530.19, "to": 532.53, "sid": 267, "location": 2, "content": "那二口的话也是会扣掉很多的分数的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 532.53, "to": 534.6, "sid": 268, "location": 2, "content": "所以这就是今天啊jackey和大家分享", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 534.6, "to": 536.429, "sid": 269, "location": 2, "content": "就是你在做口译的练习", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 536.429, "to": 538.559, "sid": 270, "location": 2, "content": "或者你在备考开题口译实务过程当中", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 538.559, "to": 543.95, "sid": 271, "location": 2, "content": "可以去复盘自己录音的一些角度和一些方法吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 543.95, "to": 545.12, "sid": 272, "location": 2, "content": "然后我建议大家呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 545.12, "to": 547.58, "sid": 273, "location": 2, "content": "是可以去自己绘制一个excel的表格", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 547.58, "to": 549.61, "sid": 274, "location": 2, "content": "你像我之前带学生们", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 549.61, "to": 551.05, "sid": 275, "location": 2, "content": "或者说带同学们去练口语的话", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 551.05, "to": 553.33, "sid": 276, "location": 2, "content": "都是会鼓励他们去做一个excel的表格", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 553.33, "to": 556.14, "sid": 277, "location": 2, "content": "然后excel表格里面就会把这些啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 556.14, "to": 558.06, "sid": 278, "location": 2, "content": "这些点都记录下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 558.06, "to": 560.89, "sid": 279, "location": 2, "content": "比如说呃ni啊有多少次对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 560.89, "to": 562.51, "sid": 280, "location": 2, "content": "改口有多少次", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 562.51, "to": 565.04, "sid": 281, "location": 2, "content": "然后就是发音错误有哪一些", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 565.04, "to": 566.69, "sid": 282, "location": 2, "content": "然后第二个原质量方面", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 566.69, "to": 567.74, "sid": 283, "location": 2, "content": "语法错误有几处", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 567.74, "to": 569.25, "sid": 284, "location": 2, "content": "分别是什么样的语法错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 569.25, "to": 571.05, "sid": 285, "location": 2, "content": "用词有哪些用的不当的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 571.05, "to": 573.18, "sid": 286, "location": 2, "content": "或者说哪些地方是可以做的更好的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 573.18, "to": 574.05, "sid": 287, "location": 2, "content": "还有还原度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 574.05, "to": 575.989, "sid": 288, "location": 2, "content": "哪些地方是啊词对了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 575.989, "to": 577.459, "sid": 289, "location": 2, "content": "但是意思组合起来不一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 577.459, "to": 579.049, "sid": 290, "location": 2, "content": "然后把每个地方细抠出来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 579.049, "to": 580.789, "sid": 291, "location": 2, "content": "这样的话你下一边练的时候", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 580.789, "to": 583.319, "sid": 292, "location": 2, "content": "才能够针对性的去解决掉这些问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 583.319, "to": 585.299, "sid": 293, "location": 2, "content": "而不是说我每次重复重复", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 585.299, "to": 586.7, "sid": 294, "location": 2, "content": "我说的越来越顺", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 586.7, "to": 587.87, "sid": 295, "location": 2, "content": "说得越来越流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 587.87, "to": 590.78, "sid": 296, "location": 2, "content": "但是过程当中可能是在流畅的基础上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 590.78, "to": 592.38, "sid": 297, "location": 2, "content": "犯之前同样的错误", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 592.38, "to": 595.44, "sid": 298, "location": 2, "content": "或者说只是盲目的把这个参考英文给背下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 595.44, "to": 597.42, "sid": 299, "location": 2, "content": "但是人家的这个参考译文", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 597.42, "to": 600.559, "sid": 300, "location": 2, "content": "和你口译录音当中的这个差距在哪里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 600.559, "to": 602.089, "sid": 301, "location": 2, "content": "没有去进行一个深度的分析", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 602.089, "to": 604.95, "sid": 302, "location": 2, "content": "那这就是今天啊关于口译录音复盘", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 604.95, "to": 606.21, "sid": 303, "location": 2, "content": "给大家一些建议了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 606.21, "to": 607.41, "sid": 304, "location": 2, "content": "大家如果觉得不错呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 607.41, "to": 609.69, "sid": 305, "location": 2, "content": "也欢迎大家能够点赞分享给身边", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 609.69, "to": 611.01, "sid": 306, "location": 2, "content": "正在准备口译实务", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 611.01, "to": 613.04, "sid": 307, "location": 2, "content": "或者说n t i口译复试的同学们了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 613.04, "to": 614.78, "sid": 308, "location": 2, "content": "然后大家感兴趣系统的学习口译呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 614.78, "to": 616.3, "sid": 309, "location": 2, "content": "也欢迎大家来私信我", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 616.3, "to": 618.46, "sid": 310, "location": 2, "content": "和我约一个一对一的口译测试", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 618.46, "to": 620.71, "sid": 311, "location": 2, "content": "我会根据你的口译录音或者笔译的译文", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 620.71, "to": 621.8, "sid": 312, "location": 2, "content": "来给出啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 621.8, "to": 625.659, "sid": 313, "location": 2, "content": "像详细的反馈建议和学习的这个备考建议", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 625.659, "to": 626.979, "sid": 314, "location": 2, "content": "那我们今天这一期到这里", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 626.979, "to": 627.639, "sid": 315, "location": 2, "content": "下期再见", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 627.639, "to": 628.869, "sid": 316, "location": 2, "content": "我是可乐老师jacky", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 628.869, "to": 629.5, "sid": 317, "location": 2, "content": "拜拜", "music": 0.0}]}]}